{"uid":"src/box_tree.c::bt_box_hidden","name":"bt_box_hidden","qualname":"bt_box_hidden","kind":"function","file":"src/box_tree.c","line":776,"end_line":787,"language":"c","signature":"int bt_box_hidden(const pv_box_def *boxes, size_t nbox, size_t bid)","params":[{"name":"boxes","annotation":"pv_box_def *","default":"","kind":"positional"},{"name":"nbox","annotation":"size_t","default":"","kind":"positional"},{"name":"bid","annotation":"size_t","default":"","kind":"positional"}],"returns":"int","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Stage 2b visibility gate: 1 when the box at `bid` or any ancestor on the parent_id chain has visibility HIDDEN/COLLAPSE (the same simplification the in-flow path makes -- a visible re-entry under a hidden ancestor stays hidden).","description":"The walk is bounded by nbox links and fails closed (returns 1, hidden) on NULL boxes, an out-of-range bid, a dangling parent link or a parent cycle -- a hostile box tree can never make it loop or read out of bounds. Pure; no allocation.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[["Inherited","Documentation from `bt_box_hidden` (include/box_tree.h:233)."]],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"src/box_tree.c","members":[],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
